      "message": "I wondered if we needed an \"s\" option to create a symbol map, but it looks like that\u0027s implied by --format\u003dgnu. Even GNU \"ar\" seems to add a symbol map unless I use \"S\" to turn it off.\n\nI think we could add all the files in one go:\n\n\"${LLVM_AR}\" --format\u003dgnu rcs \"${outfile}\" \"$@\"\n\nIt looks like llvm-ar and GNU ar are happy with a \"[llvm-]ar rcs $output\" command creating an empty archive.",
